# OBJ where one face is defined before any `g` directive (so its
# vertex_group_index stays at -1) and another face is inside a vertex
# group. has_vertex_groups_ becomes true via the second face, so the
# importer allocates dverts; the first face then exercises the
# negative-group-index code path in create_faces() at obj_import_mesh.cc.
v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 0 1 0
v 1 1 0
v 2 0 0
v 2 1 0
f 1 2 3
f 2 4 3
g group_a
f 2 5 4
f 5 6 4
